== Description ==

'''Circuit Board''' is an electronic component in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Laser Trap]], [[Rotor]], [[Flexible Rotor]], [[Rotating Blade]], [[Rotating Circular Saw]], [[Sensor Spike]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

